<title>USA: St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts compared withThursday, prices were $0.50 lower. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   220-250 lbs 53.50</p>
<p>			 250-260 lbs 53.00-53.50</p>
<p>			 260-270 lbs 52.00-53.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3	   300-450 lbs    44.50-45.00</p>
<p>			 450-500 lbs    47.00-47.50</p>
<p>			 500-550 lbs    48.00-49.00</p>
<p>			 550-700 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
